                "entry_id": "4b94a02c-adc5-3f5c-9237-db4acb1c924e",
                "word": "fashioned",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0537cdd4-ed65-487d-9ba8-e967e8007af6",
                        "entry_id": "4b94a02c-adc5-3f5c-9237-db4acb1c924e",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more fashioned"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4eed8764-c836-4ba2-a51d-008ac59e3005",
                        "entry_id": "4b94a02c-adc5-3f5c-9237-db4acb1c924e",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most fashioned"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "50f38f07-1df3-356d-bd04-acf3f28595c9",
                        "entry_id": "4b94a02c-adc5-3f5c-9237-db4acb1c924e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a specified fashion or style"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in-compounds"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b8cb00e-640e-42e2-9e3c-989584dc160c",
                                "sense_id": "50f38f07-1df3-356d-bd04-acf3f28595c9",
                                "text": "It was neatly arranged with old fashioned furniture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffaddf74-23fb-4141-b6a1-e4c16988acf0",
                                "sense_id": "50f38f07-1df3-356d-bd04-acf3f28595c9",
                                "text": "I've been thinking of that for a while; I was going to go with Island Fashioned or Eastern Fashion, but they both sound shit."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "612e56e0-7a7a-3992-b50e-179616ad17e6",
                        "entry_id": "4b94a02c-adc5-3f5c-9237-db4acb1c924e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In style; fashionable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71109549-a81f-48ae-8038-f1fae1d55f4f",
                                "sense_id": "612e56e0-7a7a-3992-b50e-179616ad17e6",
                                "text": "It was there also that, untill 1783, the famous Carlin performed his italian jokes, then very fashioned , and to which, since, has succeeded nobler kind of plays."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30e47a9d-9bd5-4fa3-9869-db0eb51c6b2f",
                                "sense_id": "612e56e0-7a7a-3992-b50e-179616ad17e6",
                                "text": "I praised the tie of a ribbon, carelessly, the next afternoon, — declare it's every word true, sir ; — she met me in the evening with that very fashioned tie"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c24f3374-93f0-42b8-8819-e053e772e290",
                                "sense_id": "612e56e0-7a7a-3992-b50e-179616ad17e6",
                                "text": "I like the appearance of both those sisters very much: they look spirited & accomplished, & informed; they are both handsome, & have good figures, & a very fashioned look & manner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35658278-c8a5-47e9-a20b-d8e673d18e4f",
                                "sense_id": "612e56e0-7a7a-3992-b50e-179616ad17e6",
                                "text": "Timofay clams right up, but being very fashioned and eloquent, he bids them all a loving smile, as getting to know them was not the reason for making this trip, for He knows that women come as frequently as the changing of the tide and will always be there."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84f59526-0017-3067-bc88-10b8559e21c0",
                        "entry_id": "4b94a02c-adc5-3f5c-9237-db4acb1c924e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Well designed or put together."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc3e7c40-dd1c-4f28-8b05-e8dd6f5d21fb",
                                "sense_id": "84f59526-0017-3067-bc88-10b8559e21c0",
                                "text": "“Transitionology” developed in Spain into a very fashioned discipline that left a strong footprint on the whole of Eastern and Central European studies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a666625b-6644-4c3d-9be9-12a5475aafeb",
                                "sense_id": "84f59526-0017-3067-bc88-10b8559e21c0",
                                "text": "As I have mentioned earlier, your thoughts and emotions are functioning perfectly and must be using them in a very fashioned and orderly manner, if ever, guided by an Entity or an Angel spirit along the way if you find difficulty in adjusting to the new environment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f294723c-471f-4c28-9671-f383d8df86af",
                                "sense_id": "84f59526-0017-3067-bc88-10b8559e21c0",
                                "text": "May not some books be more technically difficult to put together than others, and may not their raw material be less fashioned, less well prepared?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f22e91a1-0702-467c-93ef-79a6ff2a7abd",
                                "sense_id": "84f59526-0017-3067-bc88-10b8559e21c0",
                                "text": "Men's talking and demeanor is very fashioned, while a woman's is hot air and wild just as in sex and politics."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ab296d0-03f7-4b2f-a484-15cb95ab0689",
                                "sense_id": "84f59526-0017-3067-bc88-10b8559e21c0",
                                "text": "It remains more open, less formal, seemingly less fashioned."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
